PERMITTED USE

You may inspect, download, build, and run Spec17 for noncommercial purposes.
You may fork Spec17 on GitHub under GitHub’s Terms of Service. You may
modify your fork or a local copy and submit those changes to the
official project under the contribution terms in CONTRIBUTING.md.

A business or other organization may use Spec17 free of charge for its own
commercial work if it meets both of these conditions:
- Fewer than 20 people work in the organization, including employees,
  working owners, and regular contractors.
- Its total gross revenue for the preceding 12 months is less than USD 1,000,000
  or the equivalent in other currencies.
Count headcount and revenue across the organization and all entities that control it,
that it controls, or that are under common control with it. The free grant covers
use on multiple repositories, on users’ machines, and in the organization’s CI.
It does not extend to operating Spec17 on behalf of a customer that does not qualify.

