EVALUATION

An organization of any size may use Spec17 free of charge for 32 consecutive days to evaluate
it for internal use, including on its own private repositories and in CI.
The period starts with the organization's first use under this grant. It does not restart
for another user, repository, installation, or release.

After the evaluation ends, continued use must qualify under another
grant in this license or be covered by a separate written license.

